# Master Farmer - Grindbot

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root before any change. It is the
single rule set shared by Cursor and Claude Code — edit rules there, not here.

The project home is `C:\Users\ebene\OneDrive\Desktop\SNES_\`. Open
`SNES_\Master_Farmer_Grindbot` for work. Local version builds go in `SNES_`,
not on the desktop beside it.

The essentials, so they are never missed:

- Every material change: bump `version.lua` + every `-- Version:` banner, add a
  `VERSIONING.md` row, run `python make_local.py` (regenerates `manifest.lua`).
- Then commit on `dev`, push, open the PR to `main` and **merge it** — the game
  loads from GitHub `main`, so uncommitted work never reaches it.
- Never stage `plugin_loader.zip`; do not change `plugin_loader/` without the
  user's approval.
- Only use APIs declared in the `.api` stubs (`00-no-guessing-index.mdc`).
